<mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Steps&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6c8ebf&quot;&gt;People and agents&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;End users, admins, and AI agents acting inside the org.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#6c8ebf&quot;&gt;Work with data&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The day-to-day activity Purview needs visibility into.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#82b366&quot;&gt;Purview's five outcomes&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Know, protect, govern, comply, and secure AI.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;4. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#d79b00&quot;&gt;Non-Microsoft clouds / SaaS / on-prem&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Inbound — external estates Purview reaches into.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;5. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#9673a6&quot;&gt;Copilots, agents, third-party AI apps&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Bidirectional — AI reads content and writes interaction logs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;6. &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#b85450&quot;&gt;Regulators and auditors&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Consume evidence without touching content directly.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fillColor=#F5F5F5;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1560" y="150" width="320" height="520" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
